1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,710
This is your complete travel guide to oxford England one of the most historic beautiful and academical cities on the planet.
这是牛津的完整旅行介绍。作者称它为地球上最有历史、最美、最有学术气息的城市之一。

2
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:14,150
I'll show you everything from how to get around the place the best attractions to see.
我会介绍如何逛这座城市，以及哪些景点值得看。

3
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:23,570
Where to find those world class museums and how to have a great time in the most famous university city in the world.
哪里能找到一流博物馆，以及怎样在作者所称最有名的大学城玩得开心。

4
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:39,270
So welcome to oxford home to brilliant minds ancient buildings and magical filming locations.
欢迎来到牛津，这里有聪明的头脑、古老建筑和充满魔法气息的取景地。

5
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:47,600
Whether you're here for the history the university tours the famous museums or you just want to walk around pretending you're in a harry potter film.
不管你是为历史、大学游览、著名博物馆而来，还是只想四处走走，假装身在《哈利·波特》电影里。

6
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:52,550
That's okay because I'll show you everything you need to know before you go.
都没关系，我会介绍出发前需要知道的事。

7
00:00:52,560 --> 00:01:00,110
So let's start by looking at a map of oxford and as you can see it's incredibly small and walkable.
先看一下牛津地图。如你所见，作者觉得它非常小巧，很适合步行。

8
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:08,590
To make life easy for you I recommend that you walk in a circle and that's will cover most of the main attractions that you're looking for.
为了方便，我建议绕一圈走，这样基本能覆盖你想看的主要景点。

9
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:15,190
Let's start right here at our first attraction oxford castle and prison.
从这里开始，第一个景点是牛津城堡和监狱。

10
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:22,080
This is the best place to start because it's right next to the train station and it introduces oxford's medieval beginnings.
这里适合做起点，因为就在火车站旁边，也能带你了解牛津的中世纪起源。

11
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:35,910
Originally built in 1071 this castle and saxon tower has great views across the city and a prison that operated until 1996 yes really.
作者介绍，城堡始建于一〇七一年，撒克逊塔能俯瞰城市，监狱一直运作到一九九六年。真的。

12
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:45,590
I'd recommend paying for an admission fee and going on a guided tour with someone in a very fetching costume telling you all about the history of this place.
我建议付门票参加导览，让一位穿着很抢眼服装的人介绍这里的历史。

13
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:53,030
It's historical atmospheric and it gives you a brilliant introduction to oxford's medieval past.
这里有历史、有氛围，能让你很好地认识牛津的中世纪往事。

14
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:58,310
You'll also get access to its creepy underground crypts with a few ghost stories to boot.
还能进入阴森的地下墓室，额外听几个鬼故事。

15
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:08,510
And included in the price is access to a medieval moat aka a big hill that you can climb for even more great views around the city.
门票还包括一处中世纪 moat，作者解释为一座能爬上去看景的大土丘。

16
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:15,840
It is kind of strange to be on a giant grassy hill in the middle of a built up area surrounded by buildings but okay.
在建筑包围的建成区中央，站在巨大草坡上，感觉有点奇怪，不过也行。

17
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:24,560
If you need modern amenities the westgate shopping centre is around the corner it's oxford's giant modern shopping complex.
如果需要现代设施，Westgate 购物中心就在拐角，是牛津的大型现代购物商场。

18
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:27,750
Just in case you need to spend some money buying things.
以防你想花点钱买些东西。

19
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:34,510
The rooftop eating terrace is nice and it gives you amazing views over the city whilst you're having dinner.
屋顶餐饮露台很不错，吃晚餐时还能欣赏城市景色。

20
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:42,990
I recommend walking up the street and making a quick stop at the museum of oxford to learn all about the history of the city.
我建议沿街走，在牛津博物馆短暂停留，了解城市历史。

21
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:48,920
Given that it's free it's worth 20 minutes of your time to explore and there's some great exhibits on display here.
作者说那里免费，值得花二十分钟看看，有一些很棒的展品。

22
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:57,870
Literally across the street you'll find carfax tower this is the traditional center of the city of oxford.
就在街对面是 Carfax 塔，也就是作者所说的牛津传统市中心。

23
00:02:57,880 --> 00:03:02,949
It's a medieval church tower offering panoramic views across the skyline.
这座中世纪教堂塔能让人看到城市天际线的全景。

24
00:03:02,959 --> 00:03:12,760
You can pay to climb to the top where you'll get amazing views of the entire city especially on a nice day like today and when you come back down.
可以付费登顶，看到整座城市，尤其是像今天这样的好天气。然后下来时……

25
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:26,240
You're right in the heart of the town center the town of oxford itself is quaint easy to navigate and full of shops cafes pubs street buskers and about 500 students cycling around the place.
就回到市中心了。牛津小巧古雅，容易走，到处是商店、咖啡馆、酒吧、街头艺人，还有作者打趣说的五百个骑车学生。

26
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:28,720
It's very pleasant to walk around indeed.
的确，很适合随意走走。
